OL,3,GNEWSA'Eddie Hall inspired me to become
OL,4,Aa medal-winning strongman'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university student inspired by former
OL,7,Fworld's strongest man Eddie Hall has
OL,8,Fwon two gold medals at an international
OL,9,Fpowerlifting competition.
OL,11,FHasan Amjad, from Wolverhampton,
OL,12,Frepresented England in the under-105kg
OL,13,Fjunior men's equipped full-power and
OL,14,Fequipped bench press events at the 2026
OL,15,FCommonwealth Powerlifting Championships
OL,16,Fin Canada.
OL,18,FThe Keele University computer science
OL,19,Fstudent took up the sport after
OL,20,Fwatching videos of Stoke-on-Trent's
OL,21,FHall, who was named world's strongest
OL,22,Fin 2017.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
