OL,3,GNEWSA'Eddie Hall inspired me to become
OL,4,Aa medal-winning strongman'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmjad said hearing the national anthem
OL,7,Fon the podium in September was a
OL,8,Fspecial moment, having always
OL,9,Fenvisioned representing his country.
